---
interface Props {
    avatarSrc?: string;
    avatarAlt?: string;
    ctaHref?: string;
    ctaLabel?: string;
}

const {
    avatarSrc = "/src/assets/developer.jpg",
    avatarAlt = "Charles, founder of post bridge",
    ctaHref  = "#",
    ctaLabel = "Try it for free",
} = Astro.props;
---

<section class="founder-root " aria-label="Founder story">
    <div class="founder-card">

        <!-- Avatar -->
        <div class="founder-avatar-wrap" aria-hidden="true">
            <img
                    src={avatarSrc}
                    alt={avatarAlt}
                    class="founder-avatar"
                    width="88"
                    height="88"
                    loading="lazy"
                    decoding="async"
            />
        </div>

        <!-- Identity -->
        <div class="founder-identity">
            <h2 class="founder-name">
                hey! it's <span class="founder-name__accent">Charles</span>
            </h2>
            <p class="founder-subtitle">(the guy who made RareBooks)</p>
        </div>

        <!-- Story paragraphs -->
        <div class="founder-story" role="article">
            <p>
                for <strong>more than half a decade</strong> i have worked closely with small and growing businesses helping them automate their business operations.
                i kept seeing the exact same problems everywhere.
            </p>
            <ul class="founder-story__list">
                <li>
                    business owners managing stock, sales and expenses with notebooks.
                </li>
                <li>
                    sales records written manually.
                </li>
                <li>
                    expenses tracked in spreadsheets.
                </li>
                <li>
                    employees <strong>forgetting to record sales</strong> properly.
                </li>
                <li>
                    owners having <strong>no clear visibility</strong> of what was happening in their own businesses <strong>unless they were physically present.</strong>
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                and when stock went missing, or profits didn’t match expectations, they had to spend hours manually checking notebooks
                against shelves and warehouse stock just to figure out what happened.
                what surprised me most was this:
            </p>
            <p>
                most existing softwares weren’t actually built for these businesses.
            </p>
            <p>
               the systems were too expensive, too complicated, and often required accounting or technical knowledge that many SMEs simply don’t have.
            </p>
            <p>
                many businesses employ hardworking people with <strong>little or no technical background</strong> — not accountants, not analysts, not computer experts.
                they just needed something simple enough for anyone to use. something that helps the owner stay in control without needing to sit in the shop all day.
            </p>
            <p>
                so <strong>i built Rarebooks.</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
                a simple business operating system designed specifically for SMEs.
                with Rarebooks, business owners can instantly know:
            </p>
            <ul>
                <li>
                    what stock was sold,
                </li>
                <li>
                    when stock is running low,
                </li>
                <li>
                    when new stock arrives,
                </li>
                <li>
                    daily revenues and expenses,
                </li>
                <li>
                    profit & loss,
                </li>
                <li>
                    and what’s happening in the business even while they are away.
                </li>
            </ul>
            <p>
                employees don’t need accounting degrees or advanced computer skills to use it.
            </p>
            <p>
                the system is built to be simple, practical, and easy to operate from day one.
            </p>
            <p>
                what started from observing the struggles of businesses during consulting has now become <strong>a platform helping SMEs run with more clarity, accountability, and confidence.</strong>
            </p>
            <p>
                because small businesses shouldn’t need complicated enterprise software just to stay organized.
            </p>
            <p>
                they deserve tools built for the reality of how they actually operate.
            </p>
            <p>
                and that’s why Rarebooks exists.
            </p>
        </div>

        <!-- CTA -->
        <div class="founder-cta-wrap">
            <a href={ctaHref} class="founder-cta">{ctaLabel}</a>
        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<style>
    /* ─── Tokens ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .founder-root {
        --green:       #22c55e;
        --green-dim:   #16a34a;
        --ink:         #1a2332;
        --ink-body:    #374151;
        --ink-muted:   #6b7280;
        --border:      #d1fae5;        /* soft green tint */
        --bg-page:     #f9fafb;
        --bg-card:     #f4faf6;
        --radius-card: 20px;
        --font-sans:   "DM Sans", system-ui, sans-serif;

        //background: var(--bg-page);
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
        align-items: flex-start;
        padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 32px);
        font-family: var(--font-sans);
    }

    /* ─── Card ────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .founder-card {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 640px;
        background: var(--bg-card);
        border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: var(--radius-card);
        padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 52px) clamp(24px, 5vw, 52px);
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0;
    }

    /* ─── Avatar ──────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .founder-avatar-wrap {
        width: 90px;
        height: 90px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        overflow: hidden;
        border: 3px solid white;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(34, 197, 94, .2);
        margin-bottom: 8px;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        background: var(--border);   /* placeholder tint if img missing */
    }
    .founder-avatar {
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        object-fit: cover;
        display: block;
    }

    /* ─── Identity ────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .founder-identity {
        text-align: center;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
    }
    .founder-name {
        font-size: 1.35rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: -0.01em;
        color: var(--ink);
        margin: 0 0 4px;
        line-height: 1.2;
    }
    .founder-name__accent { color: var(--green); }

    .founder-subtitle {
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        color: var(--ink-muted);
        margin: 0;
        font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* ─── Story body ──────────────────────────────────────── */
    .founder-story {
        width: 100%;
        display: flex;
        flex-direction: column;
        gap: 16px;
        margin-bottom: 36px;
    }
    .founder-story p {
        margin: 0;
        font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.6vw, 0.975rem);
        line-height: 1.68;
        color: var(--ink-body);
        font-weight: 400;
    }
    .founder-story strong {
        font-weight: 700;
        color: var(--ink);
    }
    .founder-story__free {
        color: var(--green);
        font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* ─── CTA ─────────────────────────────────────────────── */
    .founder-cta-wrap {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: center;
    }
    .founder-cta {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 13px 36px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--green);
        color: #fff;
        font-size: 0.925rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        letter-spacing: 0.01em;
        box-shadow: 0 2px 14px rgba(34, 197, 94, .32);
        transition: opacity 0.18s ease, transform 0.18s ease, box-shadow 0.18s ease;
    }
    .founder-cta:hover {
        opacity: 0.9;
        transform: translateY(-1px);
        box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(34, 197, 94, .42);
    }
    .founder-cta:active {
        transform: translateY(0);
        opacity: 1;
    }
</style>